This repository is under several licenses. In short:

- Data from public institutions (most of data/): each source's own license
  and credit line, one row per source in LICENSES.md.
- Expat Living Italy's own curation (the regime rules and the figures derived
  from them): CC BY-NC 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
  Credit required; commercial use only by agreement
  (https://www.expatliving.it/contact).
- Documentation (README.md, LICENSES.md, CHANGELOG.md, api/, llms.txt):
  CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- Scripts (scripts/, .github/workflows/): MIT, full text in scripts/LICENSE.

LICENSES.md is the reference: which license applies to which file, and the
attribution each source asks for.
